# Restatement ledger (docs/standards/architecture.md rule 9) for which model each agent
# role runs on, owned by CLAUDE.md § Model tiers, whose Sonnet routing graduated from
# #607's pilot on 2026-10-15.
#
# The frontmatter `model:` lines are the executable carriers: the harness reads them, so
# they hold the literal. The planner's Fable-or-Opus choice is stated once, in
# .claude/skills/plan-issue/SKILL.md step 2. The other skill carriers state the conserve
# downgrade or the model a dispatch runs on. The sweep's first arm is the owner's section
# name, which a citing carrier quotes; the second is the three model names, which a
# restating carrier cannot avoid. The three logs are out of scope: they narrate past runs.
owner: CLAUDE.md
claim: which model each agent role runs on — implementation, review, confirmation, planning, consulting, browser-smoke and orchestration
sweep: (?i)\bModel tiers\b|\b(fable|opus|sonnet)\b
scope: :!docs/tech-debt.md :!docs/friction-log.md :!docs/review-feedback.md
carrier: .claude/agents/browser-smoke.md
carrier: .claude/agents/confirmation-reviewer.md
carrier: .claude/agents/consultant.md
carrier: .claude/agents/implementer.md
carrier: .claude/agents/planner.md
carrier: .claude/agents/reviewer.md
carrier: .claude/agents/task-orchestrator.md
carrier: .claude/agents/ticket-agent.md
carrier: .claude/skills/budget-sync/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/burn-backlog/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/execute/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/plan-issue/SKILL.md
carrier: .claude/skills/run-issue/SKILL.md
carrier: docs/design/task-orchestrator.md
